"""French and Arabic for every message in translations/messages.pot.

Keyed on the English source exactly as it appears in the catalog. Applied by
tools/i18n_apply.py, which never overwrites a msgstr someone has already
edited by hand.

Terminology follows Tunisian administrative usage rather than a literal gloss:
B3 is "بطاقة عدد 3" / "Bulletin n°3", CIN is "بطاقة التعريف الوطنية", and
"governorate" is "ولاية". These are the terms most in need of a native
reviewer's eye before the portal faces real citizens.
"""

TRANSLATIONS: dict[str, dict[str, str]] = {}

